The Kernel type appears to be sealed, so I cannot subclass it for testing. I will instead mock the ILoggerFactory and ILogger interfaces and create a minimal fake Kernel object with the necessary properties to test the logging call. I will also mock the file system calls to avoid actual file IO. I will submit a test file with these changes. 

